<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IRT Property started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IRT Property started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers has initiated coverage of IRT Property Co with a strong buy rating and a 12-month price target of 13, the brokerage house said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The Atlanta-based real estate investment trust bolstered its capital structure and positioned itself for acquisitions with a $66-million common stock offering in January, Salomon noted.</p>
<p>-- IRT shares traded at 11.25 on Monday, up 0.125.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
